From 83e888749b9db5d0593f80b177bfc96a871977ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:09:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban: ready-wait notices name the card's last
 checkpoint (kanban-3debc730ab)

A ready card whose latest run parked (continued/blocked/scheduled) now carries that run's checkpoint
(first line, 200 chars, plus its end time) in chat_wait_unclaimed and dependency_parent_unclaimed
payloads, and the notice text and kanban_show ready hint say: Last checkpoint (HH:MMZ): "...". Read it
before re-placing the card or creating a replacement; resume or finish what it records.

t_01a1c59e0410b2fb recorded 'LANDED: PR1148 MERGED' only as a continued run's checkpoint; the 09:11Z
ready-wait notice carried queue state only and the chat duplicated the landing card for a merged PR.
